 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.party",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.1667,
   "text": "In this town, every single night, the whole town went to a party."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.home",
   "start": 3.1667,
   "end": 4.3333,
   "text": "Nobody ever went home."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.dinner",
   "start": 4.3333,
   "end": 5.6,
   "text": "And nobody ever ate dinner."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.me",
   "start": 5.6,
   "end": 6.9,
   "text": "Everybody thought that was normal."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.normal",
   "start": 6.9,
   "end": 9.6667,
   "text": "I did not. I thought it was the strangest thing in the world."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.cook",
   "start": 9.6667,
   "end": 10.8333,
   "text": "I wanted to be a cook."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.chop",
   "start": 10.8333,
   "end": 13.4333,
   "text": "So while they were dancing, I was at home. Chopping."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.bro",
   "start": 13.4333,
   "end": 16.3667,
   "text": "Every night my friends called me. Bro. Come on."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.yolo",
   "start": 16.3667,
   "end": 17.5333,
   "text": "You only live once."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.said",
   "start": 17.5333,
   "end": 20.5333,
   "text": "I said I know. That is exactly why I am staying in."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.mum",
   "start": 20.5333,
   "end": 22.7333,
   "text": "My mum served cereal at eleven at night and called it dinner."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.fridge",
   "start": 22.7333,
   "end": 24.5,
   "text": "Our fridge had one thing in it. A fridge."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.onion",
   "start": 24.5,
   "end": 27.0333,
   "text": "At a party I watched a kid eat a raw onion like an apple."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.dog",
   "start": 27.0333,
   "end": 29.4333,
   "text": "The dog ate better than the children. The dog ate grass."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.vending",
   "start": 29.4333,
   "end": 31.9,
   "text": "The town had one restaurant. It was a vending machine."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.queue",
   "start": 31.9,
   "end": 33.1333,
   "text": "There was a queue for it."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.ask",
   "start": 33.1333,
   "end": 36.1,
   "text": "So I asked everybody the same question. Why does nobody here cook?"
  },
  {
   "id": "3.same",
   "start": 36.1,
   "end": 37.4667,
   "text": "Everybody gave me the same answer."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.time",
   "start": 37.4667,
   "end": 39.8,
   "text": "They said nobody had the time. I thought they were lazy."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.showed",
   "start": 39.8,
   "end": 41.2667,
   "text": "Then my friend showed me his kitchen."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.brand",
   "start": 41.2667,
   "end": 43.7333,
   "text": "It was brand new. Everything was still wrapped."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.never",
   "start": 43.7333,
   "end": 45.6667,
   "text": "Not used. Not once."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.every",
   "start": 45.6667,
   "end": 48.6333,
   "text": "I looked in every house on my street. Every kitchen was the same."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.school",
   "start": 48.6333,
   "end": 51.7667,
   "text": "The school had no cooking class. It had four party classes."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.name",
   "start": 51.7667,
   "end": 54.2667,
   "text": "So why has nobody in this town ever cooked anything?"
  },
  {
   "id": "4.lazy",
   "start": 54.2667,
   "end": 56.8,
   "text": "I thought they were lazy. I was wrong."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.truth",
   "start": 56.8,
   "end": 60.6667,
   "text": "They had never eaten cooked food. Not one of them. Not ever."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.cannot",
   "start": 60.6667,
   "end": 62.6667,
   "text": "You cannot want a thing you have never had."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.plate",
   "start": 62.6667,
   "end": 65.6333,
   "text": "I took a plate to a party. Somebody threw it like a frisbee."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.cried",
   "start": 65.6333,
   "end": 67.7667,
   "text": "Then a grown man tasted my soup and cried."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.told",
   "start": 67.7667,
   "end": 70.1667,
   "text": "He asked me what it was. I said soup."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.whole",
   "start": 70.1667,
   "end": 72.6,
   "text": "The whole party stopped. For a bowl of soup."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.but",
   "start": 72.6,
   "end": 75.2333,
   "text": "But I still could not cook. Not at first."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.egg",
   "start": 75.2333,
   "end": 76.6333,
   "text": "I tried to fry an egg."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.flipped",
   "start": 76.6333,
   "end": 79.2667,
   "text": "I flipped it. It went up. It kept going."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ceiling",
   "start": 79.2667,
   "end": 81.5,
   "text": "It hit the ceiling. Then it came back down."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.dog2",
   "start": 81.5,
   "end": 83.6,
   "text": "It landed on the floor and the dog got there first."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.almost",
   "start": 83.6,
   "end": 87.7333,
   "text": "I stood in my kitchen, alone, and I said it out loud. Almost."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.trained",
   "start": 87.7333,
   "end": 90.4667,
   "text": "So I trained. Properly. Like an athlete."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.slow",
   "start": 90.4667,
   "end": 93.5,
   "text": "At first I chopped slowly. One onion. Then another."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.faster",
   "start": 93.5,
   "end": 95.4333,
   "text": "Then faster. Then I found the rhythm."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.chant",
   "start": 95.4333,
   "end": 96.8667,
   "text": "Huh huh huh. Huh huh huh."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.blade",
   "start": 96.8667,
   "end": 97.9333,
   "text": "My knife started to blur."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.pancake",
   "start": 97.9333,
   "end": 99.7,
   "text": "I flipped pancakes and caught them every time."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.again",
   "start": 99.7,
   "end": 101.4333,
   "text": "Then again. Then four at once."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.burn",
   "start": 101.4333,
   "end": 103.4,
   "text": "I burned a pan so badly the pan gave up."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.omelette",
   "start": 103.4,
   "end": 105.3667,
   "text": "I made omelettes until my arms stopped working."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.calendar",
   "start": 105.3667,
   "end": 107.1,
   "text": "My calendar went past like a flip book."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.months",
   "start": 107.1,
   "end": 110.3,
   "text": "Months went by. They kept dancing. I kept chopping."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.walked",
   "start": 110.3,
   "end": 112.6667,
   "text": "So I walked into the biggest restaurant in town."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.door",
   "start": 112.6667,
   "end": 114.3667,
   "text": "It was a vending machine with a door."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.asked",
   "start": 114.3667,
   "end": 115.7333,
   "text": "I asked for a job anyway."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.chef",
   "start": 115.7333,
   "end": 118.3667,
   "text": "The head chef looked at my knife. Then at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.word",
   "start": 118.3667,
   "end": 120.1,
   "text": "He said one word. When?"
  },
  {
   "id": "7.night",
   "start": 120.1,
   "end": 122.9,
   "text": "That night the kitchen got busy. Everybody in town came."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.apron",
   "start": 122.9,
   "end": 125.9333,
   "text": "I tied my apron and I was the calmest person in the building."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.hands",
   "start": 125.9333,
   "end": 129.1,
   "text": "Chopping. Flipping. Plating. Chopping again."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.smoke",
   "start": 129.1,
   "end": 132.1667,
   "text": "Somebody set something on fire behind me. I did not look."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.watch",
   "start": 132.1667,
   "end": 134.6,
   "text": "There was a lot of it I did not see. I was working."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.door",
   "start": 134.6,
   "end": 136.6667,
   "text": "Then the door opened and my old friends walked in."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.dressed",
   "start": 136.6667,
   "end": 139.1667,
   "text": "Still dressed for a party. Still not eating."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.looked",
   "start": 139.1667,
   "end": 141.2333,
   "text": "One of them looked at the kitchen. Then at me."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.wait",
   "start": 141.2333,
   "end": 143.2667,
   "text": "He said, wait. Is that him?"
  },
  {
   "id": "8.how",
   "start": 143.2667,
   "end": 145.7,
   "text": "The other one said, bro. How did you get this good?"
  },
  {
   "id": "8.turned",
   "start": 145.7,
   "end": 148.8333,
   "text": "I turned around slowly. I had been waiting years for this."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.training",
   "start": 148.8333,
   "end": 150.7667,
   "text": "I said one word. Training."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.nothing",
   "start": 150.7667,
   "end": 152.5667,
   "text": "Nobody said anything for a whole second."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.onions",
   "start": 152.5667,
   "end": 153.9333,
   "text": "Then I went back to the onions."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.chant",
   "start": 153.9333,
   "end": 155.7333,
   "text": "Huh huh huh. Huh huh huh."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.now",
   "start": 155.7333,
   "end": 157.1667,
   "text": "Now the parties start at my restaurant."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.line",
   "start": 157.1667,
   "end": 159.6333,
   "text": "The queue goes down the street. The dog is always first."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.fridge",
   "start": 159.6333,
   "end": 160.6,
   "text": "My fridge is full."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.nobody",
   "start": 160.6,
   "end": 162.8,
   "text": "And nobody has ever asked me why the parties never end."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.but",
   "start": 162.8,
   "end": 165.3333,
   "text": "I know why. Nobody in this town can cook but me."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.and",
   "start": 165.3333,
   "end": 166.6,
   "text": "And they are not going to learn."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.sub",
   "start": 166.6,
   "end": 169.5667,
   "text": "Subscribe, and I will tell you what is actually in the soup."
  }
 ],
